Package: linx
Version: 0.1.10-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DreadedZombie <joenilan+dev@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), libpipewire-0.3-0t64 (>= 0.3.8), libusb-1.0-0 (>= 2:1.0.27~rc1), libx11-6, libxcb1 (>= 1.12), libxkbcommon-x11-0 (>= 0.5.0), libxkbcommon0 (>= 0.5.0), libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, pipewire (>= 1.0), wireplumber
